# Model snapshot — generated state, so ignored rather than committed.
#
# It now lands in storage/framework/database, where stacks points snapshotDir.
# The bundled copy of the query-builder that used to ignore that setting and
# write /.qb at the project root is fixed (stacks 0.70.206 stopped inlining the
# library, bun-query-builder 0.1.63 stopped clobbering the configured value), so
# the old root path is kept here only to catch a stale install.
/storage/framework/database
/.qb
